// PROJECTION, D5 / PG-2: a print flow that only reads, and promises what print cannot carry.
//
// The flow satisfies READ, which print carries natively, so nothing it DOES is wrong. It also
// promises UNDO, CANCEL and EXIT will always be reachable. Print has no time and no interaction
// (media.json), so all three are absent from it: a guarantee the medium cannot keep.
// Until PG-2 closed, zane.js read the medium against SATISFIES only and said nothing here.
//
// Expected: VERB_NOT_CARRIED, and nothing else.

DEFINE VIBE ledger_print (
  SURFACE_AS print
)

DEFINE INTENT_FLOW read_ledger (
  SATISFIES [READ],
  ALWAYS_REACHABLE [UNDO, CANCEL, EXIT],
  ACTOR auditor
)
